"11kg Auto-shutoff Refill" is for LPG Refill only. Choose this if you already have an existing Solane AS tank.
&#xD;
&#xD;
AS (Auto-shutoff) Regulator which is exclusive to Solane has an added safety feature. When a leak is detected by the system, the regulator will automatically shut off unlike the POL variant.&#xA0;&#xD;
AS (Auto-shutoff) is also a low-pressure regulator which means the consistent release of LPG. It means more efficient use of LPG and therefore saves gas.&#xD;
&#xD;

&#xD;
Note:
&#xD;
&#xD;
Solane orders are being fulfilled by Solane distributors. Before placing your order, please ensure that your barangay is on the list of serviceable areas: https://www.landers.ph/solane-delivery-coverage. In case your location is not within Solane's scope of delivery, our Customer Service team may reach out to cancel your order.&#xD;
If you are not amenable to the fees, you may go to the Caltex Station at the Landers branch nearest you and purchase your tank there.&#xD;
Please remember to bring your tank, whether for replacement or for refill, when you go to the distributor or the Landers store.&#xD;
&#xD;
&#xA0;
